<ContentLayout structuredData={__sd} title="WD Elements 5TB portable hard drive: ownership notes | StackGeist" description="Ownership notes on the WD Elements 5TB portable hard drive (WDBU6Y0050BBK): what a large portable HDD is good for, its tradeoffs, and what to check before trusting it with backups." active="gear">
