    intro="I’ve owned this drive since at least January 2026. This page covers what a large portable hard drive like this is good for, where it falls short, and what to check before relying on it. I haven’t owned it long enough to judge long-term reliability, so this isn’t a verdict or a buying recommendation."
    productName="WD Elements Portable 5TB"
    imageUrl="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LBKkZrvgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"
    imageAlt="WD Elements Portable external hard drive"
    imageSourceLabel="Amazon"
